# VM bundles - created wherever you run bin/vm-init from (see
# bin/vm-init and README.md), including this repo's own root when
# testing. Host-local, disposable state - never part of the toolkit
# itself.
*.vmsb

# Older layout: NETMODE=user VMs used to live under a fixed build/
# directory here. No longer created, but ignored in case one lingers.
/build/
